  <AltText>
    Artfight attack of our headmate, Vihreääketty (or 'Vihre' for short), from ShinKitsune. Vihre is a kitsune with tealish blue fur, fox ears that are the same colour, pink eyes, and pink hair. They are wearing a green dress. The background is a simple grid paper with a blue sky with clouds painted onto it. Next to Vihre is their name, written in Japanese as 'ウィヒレアーケッテュ'. At the bottom is ShinKitsune's signature with all of their links.
    <!-- For their links, look above at the <AuthorLink>! -->
  </AltText>
